raig's daughter Doris Pilkington Garimara. Sampi won the 4th Annual Lexus Inside Film Awards for Best Actress on 6 November 2002 for her role in the film.\nSampi appeared in the 2007 Australian drama The Circuit as the character Leonie.\nSampi now lives in Broome, Western Australia.", "biography_author": "Wikidata", "date_of_biography": "2023-08-01T14:48:14.799856+10:00", "external_links": [{"id": 3959, "uri": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Everlyn_Sampi"}], "uuid": "41be24ed-6bb4-4b42-a748-76eb821164c9", "source": {"name": "Vernon", "slug": "vernon"}, "source_identifier": "35638", "external_references": [{"id": 25480, "source": {"name": "Wikidata", "slug": "wikidata"}, "source_identifier": "Q537980"}, {"id": 28373, "source": {"name": "VIAF", "slug": "viaf"}, "source_identifier": "76005987"}, {"id": 28374, "source": {"name": "LOC Auth", "slug": "loc-auth"}, "source_identifier": "no2003059147"}, {"id": 28375, "source": {"name": "WorldCat", "slug": "worldcat"}, "source_identifier": "lccn-no2003059147"}], "date_modified": "2023-08-01T14:48:19.496331+10:00"}, {"id": 80279, "name": "Christopher Doyle", "roles_in_work": [{"id": 2392959, "title": "Chris Doyle: Screen Worlds Spotlight interview", "work_id": 120154, "role": "interviewee", "role_id": 496, "is_primary": false}, {"id": 2392958, "title": "Chris Doyle: Screen Worlds Spotlight interview", "work_id": 120154, "role": "interviewee", "role_id": 496, "is_primary": false}, {"id": 2377968, "title": "Rabbit-Proof Fence", "work_id": 93443, "role": "cinematographer", "role_id": 32, "is_primary": false}, {"id": 2374303, "title": "Interview with Christopher Doyle", "work_id": 116781, "role": "interviewee", "role_id": 496, "is_primary": false}], "also_known_as": "", "date_of_birth": "1952", "date_of_death": "", "places_of_operation": [{"id": 3, "name": "Australia", "slug": "australia"}], "biography": "", "biography_author": null, "date_of_biography": "2023-08-09T04:11:15.100572+10:00", "external_links": [{"id": 3770, "uri": "h