isgrace. At the Film Critics Circle of Australia Awards she won the 2010 Award for Best Screenplay for Disgrace and was nominated for Best Film in 2010 (producer) for Disgrace and for Best Screenplay - Original in 2002 for La Spagnola.\nMonticelli is married to actor and director Steve Jacobs who directed La Spagnola and Disgrace.", "biography_author": "Wikidata", "date_of_biography": "2022-05-19T10:50:38.739998+10:00", "external_links": [{"id": 1661, "uri": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anna_Maria_Monticelli"}], "uuid": "e95e4bc0-47cc-4173-add2-1974d8bc7365", "source": {"name": "Vernon", "slug": "vernon"}, "source_identifier": null, "external_references": [{"id": 7247, "source": {"name": "Wikidata", "slug": "wikidata"}, "source_identifier": "Q2850555"}, {"id": 7248, "source": {"name": "VIAF", "slug": "viaf"}, "source_identifier": "120226097"}, {"id": 7249, "source": {"name": "LOC Auth", "slug": "loc-auth"}, "source_identifier": "no2009056998"}, {"id": 7250, "source": {"name": "WorldCat", "slug": "worldcat"}, "source_identifier": "lccn-no2009056998"}], "date_modified": "2023-06-14T16:33:30.576250+10:00"}, {"id": 80276, "name": "Wild Strawberries", "roles_in_work": [{"id": 1997704, "title": "La Spagnola", "work_id": 93436, "role": "production company", "role_id": 941, "is_primary": true}], "also_known_as": "", "date_of_birth": null, "date_of_death": null, "places_of_operation": [], "biography": "", "biography_author": null, "date_of_biography": null, "external_links": [], "uuid": "aa647ff7-126e-450d-8278-cccc73d8311d", "source": {"name": "Vernon", "slug": "vernon"}, "source_identifier": null, "external_references": [], "date_modified": "2023-06-14T16:33:30.576250+10:00"}, {"id": 80275, "name": "Pippa Bailey", "roles_in_work": [{"id": 882928, "title": "Inje: lost in translation", "work_id": 93431, "role": "producer/director", "role_id": 31, "is_primary": true}], "also_known_as": "", "date_of_birth": null, "date_of_death": null, "places_of_operation": [], "biography":